  },
  {
    t: 'Within 4 hours of 2.5 billion people',
    d: "Dubai sits at the intersection of Europe, Asia and Africa. Emirates alone flies to over 140 destinations, making Dubai one of the world's best-connected business addresses.",
  },
  {
    t: 'World-class banking infrastructure',
    d: 'Multi-currency accounts, SWIFT connectivity and private banking access through institutions like ADCB, Emirates NBD, Mashreq and HSBC, all operating under UAE Central Bank regulation.',
  },
